Jester Dyne Brutal IR Pack, Cookie Monster
Celestion Vintage 30 + Shure SM57, 48 kHz.

Jester Dyne Productions releases the Brutal Pack free for commercial
use (CC0 / public-domain dedication as stated on the product page).

Source: https://www.jester-dyne-productions.com/brutal-ir-pack/
Handbook maps Cookie Monster to SM57 on a Vintage 30.

ToneStar vendors a trimmed (~32 ms) mono fold of that IR as the
measured cone colour. Size and Back are recipes around this one file,
not extra mic IRs.
